docs {
  # Create a category

  Product categories the storefront and the mobile app filter by. `code` doubles as the URL slug.

  The server fills `created` with an audit stamp (`client`, `server`, `serverDate`, `serverTime` in APP_TIMEZONE, `unixTime`, `user`, `role` from the token). `status`, `statusName`, `created`, `updated`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt` and any other undeclared key are ignored if sent. An optional top-level `time` (ISO string) is recorded as `created.client`.

  ## Auth

  Bearer token of a user whose role is `ADMIN` (send **auth/Log in** first; it stores `{{token}}`).

  ## Body (JSON)

  | Field | Type | Required | Notes |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `name` | string | yes on create | 1–100 characters; unique. |
  | `code` | string | yes on create | Lowercase letters, digits and hyphens; unique; max 50. Used as the slug. |
  | `img` | string (URL) \| null | no | Category image. |
  | `description` | string \| null | no | Max 2000 characters. |

  ## Responses

  ### 201 Created

    {
      "message": "Category created",
      "data": {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "Garden",
        "code": "garden",
        "img": "https://picsum.photos/seed/lpa-garden/640/640",
        "description": "Garden gear from Lpaecomms.",
        "created": {
          "client": "2026-09-27T02:30:14.000Z",
          "server": "2026-09-27T02:30:14.000Z",
          "serverDate": "2026-09-27",
          "serverTime": "12:30:14",
          "unixTime": 1790476214,
          "user": 1,
          "role": "ADMIN"
        },
        "updated": null,
        "statusName": "ACTIVE",
        "status": 1,
        "createdAt": "2026-09-27T02:30:14.000Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T02:30:14.000Z"
      },
      "pagination": null
    }

  ### 400 Bad Request — validation failed

  A body field is missing or invalid; one `errors` entry per field.

    {
      "message": "Some fields need attention.",
      "data": null,
      "pagination": null,
      "errors": [
        {
          "field": "name",
          "message": "Invalid input"
        }
      ]
    }

  ### 401 Unauthorized — missing, invalid or expired token

    {
      "message": "Sign in to continue.",
      "data": null,
      "pagination": null,
      "errors": []
    }

  ### 403 Forbidden — the token's role is not ADMIN

    {
      "message": "You do not have permission to do this.",
      "data": null,
      "pagination": null,
      "errors": []
    }

  ### 409 Conflict — a unique field is already in use

  Unique fields: `name`, `code`. Soft-deleted records still hold their values.

    {
      "message": "A record with this name already exists.",
      "data": null,
      "pagination": null,
      "errors": [
        {
          "field": "name",
          "message": "name is already in use."
        }
      ]
    }

  Outside production, error bodies also carry `stack`.
}
